[?2004l--- TREE ---
weltquay mill
===============

weltcli/boot.rs dispatches pour.

Pipeline modules:
- octetkiln/  kiln take and emit
- stitchbay/  layout row load used by emit
- peekurn/    pour writer
- vaultbin/   baked pull used by pour
- nudgepit/   line tally

Layout rows live in /app/ribcards/LAYOUT.txt.
Each row is a name, a bit index, and a width.
pour reads /app/quaybag/night.bin and writes /app/blotbay/rows.json.

Rebuild the binary with /app/wick.sh after source edits.
